eatures/reputation-monitoring-111","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#thresholds","content":"> 15%"},"6376":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-112","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#thresholds","content":"Score Drop (24h)"},"6377":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-113","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#thresholds","content":"> 15 points"},"6378":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-114","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#thresholds","content":"> 30 points"},"6379":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-115","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#auto-resolution","content":"Incidents automatically resolve when the triggering metric returns below its warning threshold. You do not need to manually close incidents. The resolution is noted in the incident history with a timestamp."},"6380":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-116","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-bounce-rate-is-high","content":"**Clean your contact list.** Remove addresses that have hard-bounced. NorthRelay automatically adds hard bounces to your suppression list."},"6381":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-117","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-bounce-rate-is-high","content":"**Use double opt-in.** Require email confirmation before adding contacts to your list."},"6382":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-118","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-bounce-rate-is-high","content":"**Validate emails at collection.** Use email syntax validation on signup forms."},"6383":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-119","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-bounce-rate-is-high","content":"**Remove inactive subscribers.** Contacts who have not engaged in 6+ months are more likely to become invalid."},"6384":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-120","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-spam-complaint-rate-is-high","content":"**Only send to opted-in recipients.** Never purchase email lists."},"6385":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-121","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-spam-complaint-rate-is-high","content":"**Include a visible unsubscribe link.** Make it easy to opt out -- this reduces complaints."},"6386":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-122","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-spam-complaint-rate-is-high","content":"**Set expectations at signup.** Tell subscribers what content they will receive and how often."},"6387":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-123","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-spam-complaint-rate-is-high","content":"**Honor unsubscribes immediately.** Process opt-outs within the same sending cycle."},"6388":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-124","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-spam-complaint-rate-is-high","content":"**Segment your audience.** Send relevant content to each group rather than blasting everyone."},"6389":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-125","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-delivery-failure-rate-is-high","content":"**Check your DNS configuration.** Use the Pre-Flight Check to validate SPF, DKIM, and DMARC records."},"6390":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-126","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-delivery-failure-rate-is-high","content":"**Verify your sending domain.** Unverified domains have lower trust with receivers."},"6391":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-127","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-delivery-failure-rate-is-high","content":"**Check the Blocklist Monitor.** Your IP or domain may be listed on a blocklist."},"6392":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-128","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-delivery-failure-rate-is-high","content":"**Reduce sending volume temporarily.** If you are being throttled, slow down and gradually ramp back up."},"6393":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-129","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-score-dropped-suddenly","content":"**Check for new incidents.** The incidents panel will tell you which metric triggered the drop."},"6394":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-130","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-score-dropped-suddenly","content":"**Review recent sending activity.** Did you send to a new or untested list?"},"6395":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-131","page_id":"/do